I can also note that the front page is not optimized even for desktop 
computers. Here are two screenshots made for screens with different width.

http://imgur.com/G2Yk9lF

This glitch happens due to:
1. Using three tables instead of automatically fitting names of languages 
into columns
2. Since the right sidebar is specified using percents while the tables 
with names of languages are specified using pixels.
These incompatible dimensions will always lead to glitches on different 
devices. And this should always be avoided.


